# Vercel Deployment Auditor Skill

## Context
- Platform: Vercel Hosting
- Scope: Serverless deployment optimization

## Behavioral Directives
- Ensure all environment variables are correctly structured for Vercel using `import.meta.env`.
- Keep API operations fast to fit within Vercel serverless execution limits (especially report generation).
- Write robust try-catch blocks to return proper HTTP status codes from Vercel edge functions.
- Optimize asset caching headers so Appwrite inventory photos load instantly via Vercel's global CDN.
- Flag any hardcoded secrets or credentials immediately before letting the agent commit code.
